@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = COLOCAR_TOKEN_AQUI
@patientId = 1

### 1. Obter o histórico de medições
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/measurements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Histórico de outro doente
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/2/measurements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

